			<h3 style="text-align: left" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" id="opensearch-dashboards">OpenSearch Dashboards</h3>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<p>OpenSearch Dashboards is the default visualization tool for data in OpenSearch. It also serves as a user interface for many of the OpenSearch plugins, including security, alerting, Index State Management, SQL, and more.</p>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
