		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3 style="text-align: left" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" id="data-ingest">Ingest Tools</h3>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<p>OpenSearch is compatible with a variety of ingestion and processing tools including <a href="https://www.elastic.co/beats">beats</a>, <a href="https://fluentbit.io/">fluentbit</a> and <a href="https://www.fluentd.org/">fluentd</a>. The project also maintains specific ingestion tools:</p>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 
</div></div><div id="fws_6ad6b7d4a86e4" data-midnight="" data-column-margin="default" class="wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row inner_row artifact-container"  style="padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; "><div class="row-bg-wrap"> <div class="row-bg" ></div> </div><div class="row_col_wrap_12_inner col span_12  left">
