		<div class="vc_column-inner" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<p>OpenSearch Data Prepper is a component of the OpenSearch Project that accepts, filters, transforms, enriches, and routes data at scale. Distributions without a bundled JDK are also available in the <a href="https://opensearch.org/artifacts">artifacts directory</a>.</p>
</div>




		</div> 
	</div>
	</div> 

