			<h3 style="text-align: left" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" id="command-line-tools">Command Line Tools</h3>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element " >
	<p>The OpenSearch command line interface (<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">opensearch-cli</code>) lets you manage your cluster from the command line and automate tasks.</p>
</div>




